          "fontSize": 26,
          "text": "Mai bass tumse baat karna \n\nchahta tha  par tum karti nhi\n\nabb bo theek h to maine socha\n\nmai hi baat karu kuch batau  \n\naange kabhi milega nhi mauka ...\n\n\n\nAgar koi mistake vagera ho \n\nlikhne me to  ignore kar dena \n\nplz ....time lag jata h likhne me\n\naur ye sab prepare karne me actually mai chahta to samne batana ya baat karna par kaha hi kar paye .....aur secondly maine socha video bana lu to bo bhi nhi kar paya ..... To socha yahi jo karta hu vahi theek rahega ....🫡pata bhi nhi ki yaha par ho padh rhi ho ya nhi but agar padh rhi to continue continue..aram se padho jaise jaise time mile...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
